WEBVTT

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.680
In the end... a sham.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.810
An evil sword art.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:24.520
No samurai should practice it.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.610
A tactless, barbaric style.

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:30.400
Absurdity without bounds.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.370
Absurd, you say?

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:48.590
Blade of the Immortal

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.010
One, two, three

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.300
Undead tree

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.720
What truth

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:01.390
I'll come true

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:08.560
Wow...

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:12.440
I see that bright light

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:18.820
This is all I have

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:23.330
What did you say?
I know

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.880
Why do you say?

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:33.550
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:40.260
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:44.600
I got lost
I was lost

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:48.350
Survive of vision

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:51.650
Unfinished heaven

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:55.400
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:59.160
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:03.950
Survive of vision

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:24.640
If this person hadn't shown up,
I would be dead!

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.640
-I owe her my life!
-Move!

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:32.310
Rest easy. I'll put an end to your shame
right now.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.980
Shame?

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:35.990
Forget reputation!

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:38.820
Any reputation that begets an act like this--

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:40.110
I'm tired of hearing it!

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:54.250
I've changed my mind.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:57.800
Why don't we leave this woman's fate up to the heavens?

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:03.850
If she falls, she's food for the strays.
She'll be nothing but bone in an instant.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:08.560
But if she manages to survive,
well, good for her.

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:14.440
This is too much! You knocked her out
for a sick show like this? She has no chance...

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:22.820
If you trace it back, the root of the problem
was your worthlessness.

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:24.740
If you weren't my grandson...

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.460
Was there a corpse?

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:34.540
Yes.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:37.090
Then you were mistaken about her.

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:38.880
So, then what?

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:41.180
Did you give her a burial?

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:42.930
No.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:45.850
That's uncharacteristically rational of you.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:47.510
There was...

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.310
more than one corpse.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.480
There were 52.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.160
Very well then!

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.910
Hey, come over here.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.000
What are you...?

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:22.420
Lucky for you, I'm not a samurai.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:24.470
Otherwise, you'd be...

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:30.810
Only those who've mastered the sword
are true samurai.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:33.770
Most importantly, they must hold that goal
above all else.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:37.060
Etch those words into your being.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:43.610
You shameful whelp.

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:48.080
Kuroi is dead.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:50.580
And the master from my youth.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.660
Now I've even lost you.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:58.210
We swelled in number while lacking
strong, pillar swordsmen.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:01.090
Was the Itto-ryu just a giant glass tiger?

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:09.180
-Three of them.
-What?

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:10.970
That's all?

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:12.520
It's essentially a gamble.

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:15.850
That one was just an unlikely fluke.

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:20.190
Listen, we're going to be fighting to the death.

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:23.900
Unlikely flukes are simply not going to cut it.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:28.200
Oh, well. Next exercise.

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:50.220
Well, that's just no good.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.930
You'll only last five seconds against them.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.020
You'd be better off running.

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:01.230
Quit crying, you little baby.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:06.240
The first struggle in swordsmanship
is learning how weak you are.

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:09.110
Crying around like that won't make you stronger.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:12.620
Boy, am I hungry.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.910
Time for a little break.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:23.500
Ouch.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:30.180
Do I... not have the talent for this?

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:34.100
I've seen your fighting

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:36.180
up close and personal.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:38.230
But it never goes as I envision it.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.520
Are you underestimating this?

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:46.570
Some time ago, I killed 100 samurai
in a span of two years.

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:53.580
Even after surviving all those battles, honestly,
I'm just barely outlasting these Itto-ryu.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:55.200
Talent?

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:58.790
You can say that once you've tried doing
everything there is to do.

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:00.250
Don't make me laugh.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:08.190
If I could be like him...

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:25.540
Why is he here?

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:26.790
Who's there?

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.340
If you're a swordsman, why not introduce yourself?

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:31.050
I will know your ability.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:38.560
Father...

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:40.930
Mother...

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:42.890
It's essentially a gamble.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.000
Perform, Golden Bugs!

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:09.460
They hit!

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.510
Is that all?

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:22.520
A lone girl, with only these for weapons?

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.020
I'm being taken lightly.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.270
I'm a swordsman too, you know!

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:34.950
Discarding your sword may have been
the greater underestimation.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:39.780
What...?What is this?

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.460
No way! But I just saw you earlier...

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:19.910
You...?

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:31.290
It really is the Asano girl.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:35.510
That absurd technique...

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:37.760
It's not bad, but it's too unimaginative.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:40.680
Your eyes strayed from your target
before you released your grip.

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:42.600
As it stands, it's just barely a threat.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:44.850
Sorry for being absurd.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:51.230
Why do you lament?

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:54.400
Because it's frustrating, of course!

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:58.070
Someone I want to kill is right here,
but there's not a thing I can do.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:01.620
What's this all about? You going to
strip me and violate me?

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:02.700
And if I did?

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.950
I'd bite off my tongue die.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:08.160
And if I said I were going to kill you immediately?

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:10.370
I'd prefer it that way.

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.330
Come on, the sooner the better.

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:18.300
What is that about? Is that the way of the warrior?

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:21.800
Why do all of you so abruptly yearn to die?

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:24.260
You ask that,

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:26.470
but I'm just a girl, I don't know.

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:29.640
I just picked up a sword, and desired revenge.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:30.980
That's all.

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:35.440
Then why do you not beg for your life?
If you escape this place and survive,

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:38.110
another chance to attack me may very well
come your way.

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:39.860
What are you saying?

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:41.450
What are you saying?

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:44.410
You killed my father so readily,

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.700
but you're telling me to beg for my life?

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:48.790
And that I should aim to take your life

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:51.160
after you've let me live yet again?
Is that a joke?

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.210
Enough of this!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.260
Anyway, I won't be killing you here.

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:04.930
However, eventually one of my subordinates
will kill the two of you.

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:07.560
If you don't wish to die, don't involve yourself
any further.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:10.230
Why?

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:12.230
If you're going to overlook me now,

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:13.810
then why did you kill my father?

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:17.570
Just to take his reputation?
There were other ways of doing that!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:21.320
So tell me why! Why did you hate my father so much?

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:23.110
There was no ill-will.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.910
It was my duty as a swordsman.

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:26.200
Duty?

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:28.240
Wait! Hold it!

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:31.120
I have a right to hear it.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:32.080
Am I wrong?

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:36.750
Do you desire to become stronger,
day in, day out?

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:38.710
What? Yes.

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:40.260
I'm sure.

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:42.420
That's why you have that technique.

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:44.800
Two hundred years ago,

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:49.640
Oda Nobunaga's combined forces introduced
over 3,000 firearms to Japan for the first time,

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:51.770
and annihilated Takeda's cavalry units.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:56.350
Fifty years after that, Musashi Miyamoto,

00:12:56.440 --> 00:13:00.150
with the belief that swords were meant to be
wielded with one hand,

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:04.070
took a sword in each hand, and founded
the Nito Ichi-ryu.

00:13:04.820 --> 00:13:08.450
Who would point to either of them
and cry foul play?

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:10.240
Just like you right now,

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:14.540
their natural motivation to defeat their enemies
caused them to rack their brains.

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:20.000
I believe that only those who've destroyed
their own heart becoming stronger

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:23.720
should be called excellent warriors or swordsmen.

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.430
So, am I wrong?

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:27.760
What? I...

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:30.260
I don't think that's wrong.

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:32.350
Then what do you think of this?

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:44.150
Wouldn't it be easier to use a sword?

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:45.360
Indeed.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:49.450
They may be unmatched in maneuverability
and sharpness.

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:50.580
However...

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:54.830
Instead of controlling this with raw strength,

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:58.420
if I add a little direction along with the fall of the ax,

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:03.260
I can manipulate it to this level
even with the physical strength I possess.

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:05.380
And with this ax,

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:07.880
assuming my swordplay can be read,

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:11.390
I can shatter a blocking sword along with
a skull in one blow.

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:14.810
My grandfather and yours

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:18.690
were both skilled swordsmen competing for
full mastery of Muten Ichi-ryu.

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:22.570
In terms of sword skill,
my grandfather was clearly superior.

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:25.940
Yet the full mastery was granted to your grandfather.

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:27.860
Do you know why?

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.120
It's a ridiculous reason.

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:35.080
Although called a style for mere entertainment,
it was a distinguished school.

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:38.790
The disgrace of excommunication from it yet lingers.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:40.210
To this day,

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:43.170
our sword is denied the light of day, labeled taboo.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:46.460
The reason I carry a weapon like this

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:49.010
is to vindicate my grandfather.

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:51.600
Similarly, I killed your father

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:54.010
so my grandfather could be at peace.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:58.230
Even without our circumstances,

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:02.110
a human being like your father,
who had given up on becoming stronger

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:04.980
was still someone who was better off dead.

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:07.530
Why?

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:09.150
We of the Itto-ryu

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:15.660
have no qualms with using various weapons
or techniques, as long as it's one on one.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.750
It's a style, yet not a style.

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:21.710
We will never lose sight of our roles as warriors

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:27.090
unlike your father who was bound by formality,
reputation, and cheap talk.

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:32.090
Because of this, I too have many enemies.

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:36.850
If I let you go now, the next time we meet may be
a long way off.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:42.060
You may do as you like.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.860
Tell me...

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:49.570
why are you letting me live?

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:52.740
I'm a person of the Muten Ichi-ryu.

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:55.490
I'm trying to--

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.370
To kill you.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:59.370
Muten Ichi-ryu?

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:01.830
-You?
-What?

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.420
If a move like the one you used

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:08.420
came from Muten Ichi-ryu, the style would be
regarded as flawed at best.

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:13.180
Still, you joined on your own,
for the sole purpose of surpassing me.

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:15.680
You're quite the determined girl.

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:22.230
You are no longer a member of Muten Ichi-ryu.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:26.230
In more ways than not,
you are a swordsman of the same kind as us.

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:29.440
Farewell.

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.190
Devote yourself to it.

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:34.030
No...

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:37.830
I'm...

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:45.380
So... So...

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:48.210
What should I have done?

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:51.260
Damn it...

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:03.640
The same kind, huh?

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:11.990
It's been 10 years, and the first
thing we do is climb a mountain?

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:14.570
You didn't even offer a single cup of tea.

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.110
Shut up and follow me.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:22.080
What's that sound?

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.960
Look over there.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:42.770
-That's...
-It's Kagehisa.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:44.520
Kagehisa?

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:45.890
That Kagehisa?

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:48.440
The child that I once knew...?

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:58.240
Abayama.

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:02.200
I plan to kill Kagehisa today.

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:06.080
What? What are you talking about?

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:12.550
Kagehisa is trying to kill me in order to
take control of the Itto-ryu.

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:14.260
Take control?

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:15.880
A 10-year-old kid?

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.090
How absurd.

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:19.550
It's no lie.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:23.010
That large man next to Kagehisa.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.350
He used to be my disciple.

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:28.190
Now he's one of Kagehisa's followers.

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:32.570
Naturally, if I went to cut Kagehisa down,
he would stand in my path.

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:35.400
Old age is a terrifying thing.

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:37.400
Not to mention, my skills are rusty.

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:38.780
But, Abayama,

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:41.830
if you would stop that man for me,

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:43.790
-I could certainly slay Kagehisa--
-Saburo!

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.750
Abayama,

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:50.380
you're my ally, right?

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:53.130
I've been betrayed again and again.

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:56.840
First my master, then my disciple, and my son.

00:18:56.920 --> 00:19:00.800
My son... Kagehisa's father,

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:04.970
said in order to revive the dojo,
we should bend the knee to Asano.

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:08.560
He would just pester on and on, so I just...

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.230
So it wasn't the epidemic that killed him?

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:14.480
I don't intend to be betrayed by anyone else.

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:17.320
I will not be robbed. This sword,

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:20.910
and this dojo belong to me. They're mine.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.290
I understand.

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:29.000
So you'll lend a hand?

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:31.210
Yes.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:33.040
I will protect

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:35.000
your Itto-ryu.

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:38.210
I'm in your debt, Abayama.

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:44.850
I'm the one who killed Saburo Anotsu.

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:47.930
Who are you?

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:52.520
I'm Sosuke Abayama, an old friend of Saburo's.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:54.650
You... For what reason?

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:59.190
"As long as I'm here, the Itto-ryu will be
the color of shadows.

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:02.320
I won't become a living obstacle to my grandchild,"
he said.

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:04.490
I killed him in order to honor him.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:09.200
Now the Itto-ryu is publicly yours.

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:12.830
Don't let Saburo's dearest wish go unopposed.

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.750
Is this unacceptable for you?

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:18.800
No, I am honored by these circumstances.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:22.010
It seems my grandfather's selfishness
caused you trouble.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:26.140
You don't doubt my story?

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:29.060
I can see that you have only one arm.

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:33.850
Inexperienced as I am, even I know the amount of
diligent training it takes to do something like this

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:35.650
with only one arm.

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:38.270
You are a swordsman

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:40.530
far above my grandfather,

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:42.400
and perhaps anyone here at this moment.

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:47.120
"Only those who've mastered the sword
are true samurai.

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:49.830
Most importantly,
they must hold that goal above all else."

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:52.160
Of all my grandfather's words,

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:55.750
only that one ideal has moved my heart,
and in accordance with it,

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.540
I will trust you.

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:01.670
If I only wanted to put my grandfather at peace,

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:04.130
killing Asano would have been enough.

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.550
But my Itto-ryu

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:09.140
is not yet at peace.

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:11.060
Kuroi.

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:16.730
I want to create a style that mocks
my grandfather's "virtues."

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:18.560
A robust group

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:21.530
that seeks the truth in sword alone,
and exalts victory.

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:27.450
In today's world, no one will gather
under a style like that.

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:30.870
But if they did happen to...

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:41.090
I'm sure they would all be

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:46.180
villains like me, who've taken a step off
of the path of man.

00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:49.390
And that path will certainly become thorny.

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:51.720
Do you possess that resolve,

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:52.930
Master Kagehisa?

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:56.520
Yes, I welcome the challenge.

00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:28.860
Act Four – Rin at Odds
